<!-- wp:group {"className":"wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group wrap">
<!-- wp:group {"className":"head rise","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group head rise">
<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How we help you manage your <em>account.</em></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Risk management in trading isn’t a side topic for us. It’s the method. This is what a trading day looks like when every decision is planned before the click.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:group {"className":"bento","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group bento">
<!-- wp:group {"tagName":"article","className":"tile glass tilt t-full flow-tile rise","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<article class="wp-block-group tile glass tilt t-full flow-tile rise">
<!-- wp:group {"layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group">
<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Every trade, planned the same way</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Structure, entry zone, a risk check, a stop-loss and then the post in Telegram. The same five steps, in the same order, every time.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:group -->
<!-- wp:html -->
<div class="flow">
      <div class="flow-top"><b>Trade plan</b><span class="mono">Example, XAUUSD</span></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 250" role="img" aria-label="Example trade plan shown as connected steps: structure, entry zone, risk check, stop-loss and posting to Telegram">
        <path id="w1" class="wire" d="M150 52 C200 52 200 125 238 125"/>
        <path id="w2" class="wire" d="M150 198 C200 198 200 125 238 125"/>
        <path id="w3" class="wire" d="M372 125 C410 125 405 52 440 52"/>
        <path id="w4" class="wire" d="M372 125 C410 125 405 198 440 198"/>
        <g class="node"><rect x="16" y="26" width="134" height="52" rx="12"/><text x="30" y="49">Structure</text><text class="s" x="30" y="66">higher lows</text></g>
        <g class="node"><rect x="16" y="172" width="134" height="52" rx="12"/><text x="30" y="195">Entry zone</text><text class="s" x="30" y="212">pullback area</text></g>
        <g class="node hub"><rect x="238" y="96" width="134" height="58" rx="14"/><circle cx="256" cy="125" r="6" fill="#4A9CFF"/><text x="270" y="121">Risk check</text><text class="s" x="270" y="138">1% max</text></g>
        <g class="node"><rect x="440" y="26" width="72" height="52" rx="12"/><text x="452" y="49">Stop</text><text class="s" x="452" y="66">set first</text></g>
        <g class="node"><rect x="440" y="172" width="72" height="52" rx="12"/><text x="452" y="195">Post</text><text class="s" x="452" y="212">Telegram</text></g>
        <g class="pulses">
          <circle class="pulse" r="3.5"><animateMotion dur="2.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#w1"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pulse" r="3.5"><animateMotion dur="2.4s" begin="0.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#w2"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pulse" r="3.5"><animateMotion dur="2.4s" begin="1.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#w3"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pulse" r="3.5"><animateMotion dur="2.4s" begin="1.8s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#w4"/></animateMotion></circle>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <ul class="log" aria-label="Example trade log">
        <li style="--i:0"><b>07:58</b><span>London open, structure marked</span><span>done</span></li>
        <li style="--i:1"><b>08:20</b><span>Price pulls back into the zone</span><span>done</span></li>
        <li style="--i:2"><b>08:22</b><span>Stop-loss placed below the low</span><span>done</span></li>
        <li style="--i:3"><b>08:23</b><span>Size set to risk 1% of account</span><span>done</span></li>
        <li style="--i:4"><b>08:24</b><span>Entry posted to Telegram</span><span>sent</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
<!-- /wp:html -->
</article>
